    "price_claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan names it with life Gu among the unique natural Gu of that forbidden ground, whose interior is extremely wide and reflects the five regions of the main world. Chou Jiu says he explored the Door of Life and Death many times, captured some of the life Gu and death Gu inside, and eventually refined one life one death Gu. He placed that refined Gu inside the door so that whenever a person dies because of him, it absorbs the death energy and converts it into lifeforce for his healing methods.",
